OL,3,GNEWSACharles Bronson denied parole for
OL,4,Aninth time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe panel was not satisfied that his
OL,7,Frelease would be "safe for the
OL,8,Fprotection of the public", citing his
OL,9,F"limited progress" in custody and the
OL,10,Fother evidence before it.
